Error: Jet.MissingMoveMarker: `wire` cannot be moved from borrowed storage
  --> Tests/UI/user_close_holder_is_not_copied.jet:24:57
    |
 24 | wrap: fn(wire: UserWire) -> UserChild { UserChild{wire: wire} }
    |                                                         ^^^^
 Why: `wire` is a read or write parameter, so its caller keeps the value, and `UserWire` can't be copied into the struct literal
 Fix: Declare the parameter `wire: ^^UserWire` so the caller hands the value over
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.MissingMoveMarker

